  "type": "AIsubtitle",
  "lang": "zh",
  "version": "eng-1.2.0-Index-johns-pen-lite",
  "body": [
    {
      "content": "如果你一直在尝试锻炼肱二头肌",
      "from": 0.0,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 1,
      "to": 1.48
    },
    {
      "content": "我敢说你肯定在某个时候使用过某种简易杠铃弯举",
      "from": 1.48,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 2,
      "to": 4.84
    },
    {
      "content": "这些杠铃的实际结构设计",
      "from": 4.84,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 3,
      "to": 6.7
    },
    {
      "content": "是它们被设定为保持在支架上的固定位置",
      "from": 6.7,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 4,
      "to": 11.18
    },
    {
      "content": "所有杠铃都会自动归位到同一位置",
      "from": 11.18,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 5,
      "to": 12.88
    },
    {
      "content": "这是因为杠铃的工程设计原理",
      "from": 12.88,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 6,
      "to": 14.76
    },
    {
      "content": "重心使其保持这种状态",
      "from": 14.76,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 7,
      "to": 16.59
    },
    {
      "content": "但如果你这样抓握",
      "from": 16.59,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 8,
      "to": 18.45
    },
    {
      "content": "看看会发生什么",
      "from": 18.45,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 9,
      "to": 19.45
    },
    {
      "content": "我实际上正在做对肱二头肌不够高效的动作",
      "from": 19.45,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 10,
      "to": 23.64
    },
    {
      "content": "这是因为我从一个更不利的位置抓握了杠铃",
      "from": 23.64,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 11,
      "to": 28.63
    },
    {
      "content": "你可以看到我的手腕角度",
      "from": 28.63,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 12,
      "to": 31.48
    },
    {
      "content": "当我放下时是这样的未翻转状态",
      "from": 31.48,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 13,
      "to": 36.31
    },
    {
      "content": "如果你想从这个动作中获得更多效果",
      "from": 36.31,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 14,
      "to": 39.09
    },
    {
      "content": "需要在抓握前将杠铃翻转过来",
      "from": 39.09,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 15,
      "to": 41.83
    },
    {
      "content": "这样当我现在抓住外侧把手时",
      "from": 41.83,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 16,
      "to": 44.34
    },
    {
      "content": "可以看到手腕需要更充分发力",
      "from": 44.34,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 17,
      "to": 47.36
    },
    {
      "content": "抓住相同的握点",
      "from": 47.36,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 18,
      "to": 48.74
    },
    {
      "content": "然后调整到这个位置以获得更强的肱二头肌收缩",
      "from": 48.74,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 19,
      "to": 53.59
    },
    {
      "content": "并避免前臂主导肘部弯曲",
      "from": 53.59,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 20,
      "to": 57.59
    },
    {
      "content": "将杠铃拉至顶端",
      "from": 57.59,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 21,
      "to": 59.04
    }
  ]
}